et words i)\n          ((some w)\n            (cond\n              ((> (stringLength w) 0)\n                (match (mapGet counts w)\n                  ((some c)\n                    (cond\n                      ((> c best) (resultFrom words (+ i 1) counts best acc))\n                      ((< c best) (resultFrom words (+ i 1) counts best acc))\n                      (else (resultFrom words (+ i 1) counts best (mapSet acc w c)))))\n                  ((none) (resultFrom words (+ i 1) counts best acc))))\n              (else (resultFrom words (+ i 1) counts best acc))))\n          ((none) acc)))))\n\nfn histogram text: String -> (Map String Int64)\n  (let [(words (stringSplit text \" \"))\n        (counts (countFrom words 0 (mapFromPairs (list))))\n        (best (maxFrom words 0 counts 0))]\n    (resultFrom words 0 counts best (mapFromPairs (list))))\n```"))
